+ *     0xc arbitration lost. A write is done when the TX FIFO is empty and
+ *     the state is 0xe (no stop) or idle (stop).
+ *   With that, ID 0x02, B1CTRL1 0x58, B1CTRL2 0x3a (762.5 mV), RAMP 0x54.
+ *
  * Boot-arg a5cpufreq=MHZ applies a level once, 20 s after USB start.
